{
  "_note": "Genera used to set an NVS plot's stage from what it recorded, when LCDB maps the spot as open ground or an excluded cover (plots often sit in forest patches too small for LCDB). Mature: at least min_mature canopy genera. Regenerating: otherwise at least min_woody woody genera (canopy genera count as woody).",
  "min_mature": 3,
  "min_woody": 4,
